# Build a Native Android App for Mindful Digital Consumption

## 1. The Vision

Build a beautiful, lightweight, privacy-first Android application that helps users reduce impulsive spending and dependency on instant-commerce and food-delivery applications.

The app should help users become more intentional about when they order food, groceries and other daily necessities.

The primary problem it addresses is not simply excessive screen time. It is the convenience-driven cycle of repeatedly opening apps such as:

- Blinkit
- Zepto
- Swiggy
- Zomato
- Instamart
- Amazon
- Flipkart
- Other applications selected by the user

These applications offer genuine convenience, but frictionless ordering can also make unnecessary purchases and impulsive consumption easier.

The application should introduce a thoughtful pause between an impulse and an action.

**The central philosophy: Don't make the user feel guilty. Help them become conscious of their choices.**

Working name: **PAUSE** (keep the name, logo and branding easily configurable).

