First inspect the existing project and environment.

If a project already exists, preserve its working functionality and follow its existing conventions where sensible.

Then:

1. Establish the architecture and essential design system.
2. Build the onboarding and permission flow.
3. Implement app selection and actual blocking.
4. Build grocery planning and reminder features.
